{"title":"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-tuples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/e/faedb9d30dc3763d92cbcacf2cc17e2bf64f3e8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c,d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"75\" height=\"20\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> positive integers, such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/4/d044b73e7b69ee028ef1bf76033527a8f0bfc0be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-ax + b = 0, x^2-bx + c = 0, x^2 -cx + d = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"384\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2f55cf9d69662046e44894250de32216cc4bc38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-dx + a = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"124\" height=\"16\" /> have integer roots\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II\">2018 UNM-PNM Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://mathcontest.unm.edu/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2018 UNM-PNM Statewide High School Mathematics Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_UNM-PNM_Statewide_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" ti